<title>USA: Briarcliff Manor, N.Y., won by Roosevelt.</title>
<headline>Briarcliff Manor, N.Y., won by Roosevelt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Roosevelt &amp; Cross, Inc., said it won $4.101 million of Briarcliff Manor, N.Y., general obligation public improvement bonds 1996, with a true interest cost of 5.15 percent.</p>
</text>
